{"title":"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(fakesolve,_don&#39;t_do_this)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (fakesolve, don't do this)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is an isosceles triangle with base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is a point on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the point on the extension of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/4373e7b4be983c0315e82e1fda1df66ed34dd7fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BD}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> past <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/323a763d7340327b696742640e83240dd06703c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{BAE}$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" /> is right. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb65617300dca578999d04eb95146b363fc4cb5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = 15, DE = 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"148\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830de927bd8077aa97abc0e3829961d12711fe7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bf1afcb274a3bb84338109fffec8a1f1c02008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the foot of the altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> be point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> be point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e037912024535666d4f5194dcf67a6231061c8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G.$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f04fa9033ad606c2ab2f650a16c41255a91f3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BAC \\sim \\triangle BAE.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is isosceles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae96817d7989757d4321eb50f54575f4762a01d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{BE}{AB} = \\frac{1}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"77\" height=\"39\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/f/d6f489ea6e06feca9d4354b68b421924cdbef449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX = \\frac{17}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1fe1ab1957adf37804cab3b4b0219089d67df6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DX = 17 - 2 - \\frac{17}{2} = \\frac{13}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" /> Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11fca7fa0396390456782405b2897976a413f77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/857df29da7da4f8eadf2d2481dc811df53738580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4cb3f4555b3ae723a4348d035a84b4f7c6e0f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{13}{2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e4f2d5cc59e5ffbed3734130e8c45b643adc91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a4b9c32938e96f30b59dcb29f410cd4c2e3982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> by some scale factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. Also note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d450395e82d2adf400dbbf6e8dd3705acd43ce25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AGD \\sim \\triangle AFC.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" /> Then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/f/42f9460516512c9c47ebb258444b2b576f9c303a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AG}{AF} = \\frac{AD}{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"39\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/023d9334ac4f6e73dba3e2d1a37ad27293129e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\frac{2k}{AB - BF} = \\frac{AD}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"187\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00f68b242fcbb557c2cb93feb0126f11ff71ee71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\frac{2k}{17k/2} = \\frac{AD}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"154\" height=\"44\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/620b660fff8bf2be8ee0b43af93fba14e2b292e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\frac{4}{17} = \\frac{AD}{16} \\implies AD = \\frac{64}{17}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"256\" height=\"39\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/892ddd3a618e50ac327bece9782530b6db5d9416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - \\frac{64}{17} = \\frac{208}{17}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/6/6e6fa582bccaf43a146b95e994ae6ecad0633ebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$208 + 17 = \\boxed{225}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"137\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Grogg007\" title=\"User:Grogg007\">grogg007</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28fakesolve.2C_don.27t_do_this.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(fakesolve,_don't_do_this)\">Solution 2 (fakesolve, don't do this)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (fakesolve, don&#39;t do this)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/5/e852702a676b21d2bcd9820a3e570a5765ef6e7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H.$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e8e26d580012b86d8fe55e70e5740908c35af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CH$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3ce33ec2a34dc4fddaec3224043f4a72bbe6d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> Then let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3bb4eeb347e74e025fd175c22f1f7275af0555e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> intersect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/9/f2920fa2bc40ed68149a854f8b32c09f619b0d70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F.$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/842d7c42008807f4054df797524aea3dc2fec483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEB\\sim \\triangle HPB,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" /> with a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e4797950b5e812b65381cbc5fc33ad2db5f57aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35b0350a1a76633af6409c600e6ca5002b619cbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP=8.5$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/814bfb1f9ddf6bad280dcfb5233cae5710cdc5cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DP=6.5.$\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" /> Then the mass of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the mass of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a6e21d37fad69d54dc8e3c9949234ad263fd2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> and the mass of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b666be0271a13e8f33860b8c48e6e7c18b9db11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5.$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> Because the triangle is isosceles, the mass of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b666be0271a13e8f33860b8c48e6e7c18b9db11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5.$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b954f7a8f0b4afe7559a353abfd7ca14c6bf9348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD=\\frac{8.5}{8.5+6.5}\\cdot 16.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"161\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202909\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 387/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1431/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 177/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11017/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.932      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%   10.932      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4668:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202909 and revision id 253838. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}